class Solution {
    public int pivotIndex(int[] nums) {
        int leftsum=0; // sum of elements to the left of current index
        int totalsum=0;
        for(int num: nums){
            totalsum+=num; // compute total sum of array
        }

        for(int i=0; i<nums.length; i++){
            int rightsum=totalsum-nums[i]-leftsum;
            if(leftsum==rightsum){
                return i;  // found pivot index
            }
            leftsum+=nums[i]; // update left sum
        }
        return -1;
    }
}  


Complexity
Time: O(n) (single pass after computing total sum).
Space: O(1) (just a few variables).
